   What Is Collection Framework?
   Collection Framework is:
        A library of ready-made data structures provided by Java.


        Why we need it ?
        because for specific requirements if i want list structure or stack structure why should i make every data structure from
        scratch instead java provides collection frameworks which has all data structures you want to use


   What is List?
   A List is simple ordered items collection in a way it is inserted and duplicated are allowed in list

   What Is ArrayList?
   A List implemented using an internal array.
   main thing is array list is not fixed size it resize automatically

   What is LinkedList?
   A linked list is a linear data structure where elements are not stored in side-by-side memory locations.
   Instead, it forms a chain of separate items called nodes,
   where each node points to the next one using a reference or pointer.

   [ Data | Next ] ---> [ Data | Next ] ---> [ Data | NULL ]

